DESCRIPTION >
    Super-admin preview overview: most recent event (any type), for
    install-status display. Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp).
    Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/admin.js:350-355 (queryName
    'admin_preview_overview'). Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6):
    properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type. Source has NO
    event_type filter (matches any event) — preserved exactly. No JSON-bag
    fields. IDENTICAL query text to admin_preview_install.pipe
    (api/routes/admin.js:210) — duplicate logic across two handlers in the
    same file, flagged as a Phase-6 consolidation candidate (noted, not acted
    on), same treatment as the alert_*/integ_* cross-file duplicates from
    prior batches.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE admin_preview_overview_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT event_type, timestamp
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT 1

TYPE endpoint
